This package downloads, on first use, files it does not distribute. Each is pinned
by revision and verified by SHA-256 before it is used.

- NVIDIA NeMo FastConformer-Hybrid Large (Belarusian, punctuation and
  capitalization), nvidia/stt_be_fastconformer_hybrid_large_pc - CC BY 4.0,
  trained on Mozilla Common Voice 12. ONNX export by OpenVoiceOS:
  https://huggingface.co/OpenVoiceOS/stt_be_fastconformer_hybrid_large_pc_onnx
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/stt_be_fastconformer_hybrid_large_pc
- Silero VAD - MIT. ONNX packaging for onnx-asr:
  https://huggingface.co/istupakov/silero-vad-onnx
  https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad

The benchmark command downloads FLEURS (google/fleurs, Belarusian be_by) - CC BY 4.0,
Conneau et al., "FLEURS: Few-shot Learning Evaluation of Universal Representations of
Speech", 2022. The demo page includes a few unmodified FLEURS clips under that license.

Runtime libraries: onnx-asr (MIT), ONNX Runtime (MIT), soundfile (BSD-3-Clause),
NumPy (BSD-3-Clause); with the server extra, Starlette (BSD-3-Clause), Uvicorn
(BSD-3-Clause), python-multipart (Apache-2.0), HTTPX (BSD-3-Clause).
